sequenceDiagram
    participant CL as Control Loop
    participant PE as Placement Engine
    participant WS as World State (Snapshot)
    participant PR as Preemption Engine

    CL->>PE: ComputePlacement(ctx, snapshot, scalingDecisions)
    
    Note over PE: 1. Process Scale-Downs (delta < 0)
    loop For each App with delta < 0
        PE->>PE: selectScaleDownVictims
        Note right of PE: Priority: High fragmentation, Non-cached, Over-represented
        PE->>PE: Append ScaleDownDecisions
    end

    Note over PE: 2. Process Scale-Ups (delta > 0)
    Note right of PE: Sorted by App Priority (P0 First)
    loop For each replica to add
        PE->>PE: findBestCluster
        loop For each Cluster
            PE->>WS: Check Hard Constraints (Free GPUs, Spread Limit)
            alt Fits
                PE->>PE: computeCacheScore (GPU_MEMORY > NVME > STORAGE > REMOTE)
                PE->>PE: computePackingScore (Tightest Fit)
                PE->>PE: computeBalanceScore (1 - utilization)
                PE->>PE: Total Score = Cache + Frag + Balance
            end
        end

        alt Cluster Found
            PE->>PE: Create GPUReservation (TTL = 2x cold_start)
            PE->>PE: Update localReservations (track capacity in-cycle)
            PE->>PE: Append ScaleUpDecision
        else No Cluster Found
            PE->>PR: FindPreemptionOpportunity(app)
            PR-->>PE: PreemptionPlan (Victims, TargetCluster, Constraints)
            alt Preemption Possible
                PE->>PE: Append PreemptionDecisions
                PE->>PE: Create GPUReservation
                PE->>PE: Append ScaleUpDecision
            else Preemption Failed
                PE->>PE: Record No Capacity Metric
            end
        end
    end

    PE-->>CL: PlacementDecisions (ScaleUps, ScaleDowns, Preemptions)
